{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "a91e02c882eb58d1fe7c09cfa2941ecfa0ab3dde3cadf13f0a57f324f24eaa76", "ja": "そんなに大きなマフラー、大変かな？　でも、\n大は小を兼ねるっていうし、小さいよりはいいよね♪", "zh": "那么大的围巾，会不会很不方便呢？不过，俗话说大的总比小的好，肯定比小的强吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_intro_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "622ad7b6cfa893f4117a56840ee859b43ed88f7dfcf93974374568247cd1538a", "ja": "お姉ちゃんにあげてもいいし……あっ！\nそうだ、{$P$}さんに……。", "zh": "也可以送给姐姐……啊！  \n对了，送给{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_intro_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a918915ab5a9d8726e812e6c18426634f2a34f1d0677b8bcaa336d52d8c70eb3", "ja": "お疲れさまです、青羽さん。今、自分の名前が\n聞こえましたけど、どうかしましたか？", "zh": "辛苦了，青羽小姐。刚才好像听到有人叫我的名字，是怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "91d035eb6ce18b445ab7b235d42e09601e7d8c66fe7549173574978de53fae12", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです。\nこの冬の過ごし方を考えていたんですけど……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生，辛苦了。\n我正在考虑这个冬天要怎么过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "63e591393fb69a5bc7bb924dd42778c59cc201e0163140c48d50f5d8a20c0b02", "ja": "私はやっぱり、家で編み物かなって！\n{$P$}さんはどうですか？", "zh": "我果然还是想在家织毛衣！\n{$P$}先生呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "6564943070ce47fddb93dba41a2896ed06da149c1c3ba7fc9a97998805eecd00", "ja": "冬の過ごし方ですか……うーん。\nいつもどおり、仕事ですかね……。", "zh": "要说冬天怎么过吗……嗯。\n大概还是和往常一样，工作吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "cf1129818aee93d7383e5882934848d6d65f1ab9406f289d3cc221c19da2aa85", "ja": "でも、旅行とかいいかもしれませんね。\n冬ですし、温泉で骨休めとか……。", "zh": "不过，去旅行之类的或许也不错呢。\n毕竟是冬天，去泡泡温泉放松一下什么的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "5ef975b41a73403ec6cf10c16a49699a08516788feb249bf3f6ad09257bdbfee", "ja": "わあ、素敵ですね～♪　あれ？　冬、旅行……\nそうだ！　社長さんがお呼びでしたよ！", "zh": "哇，真棒呢～♪　咦？　冬天、旅行……\n对了！社长找您呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "84d6307c10992815edf23e1843dc6a68e7790dbc3bad952582bfb4b9302c6d02", "ja": "まさに、冬の季節に日本を駆け巡る\n例の企画について！　……だそうです♪", "zh": "正是关于要在冬季巡回日本的\n那个企划！……他是这么说的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d740d0c4142b0cf768a0fc4466c56631c812f73c3bc7228ef76ac054b68072a4", "ja": "冬の季節に日本を……なるほど！　それなら\n急いで向かわないと！　いってきますね、青羽さん！", "zh": "在冬季走遍日本……原来如此！那样的话，\n不赶紧出发可不行！我这就出发，青羽小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "6c34cd79702ace3adab399b055d704860b24104def231a19fb3d54e1eb30c1b6", "ja": "いってらっしゃ～い♪\n外は寒いので、防寒はしっかりですよ～！", "zh": "路上小心～♪\n外面很冷，一定要做好保暖哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_intro_1011_102mis", "source_sha256": "d15a65c8b3ad9814ecfa0e79155702e02653287884e0ce4c421cc7819ecfce57", "ja": "あっ！　大きなマフラー……社長さんと\n音無先輩も、使ってくれるかな……？", "zh": "啊！这么大的围巾……社长和音无前辈也不知道愿不愿意用……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_intro_1012_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_intro_1013_p", "source_sha256": "393fcb3e3a0aca432768afae3355e1b3fbc1ae79d0dca1d0b11a75318ad59cfb", "ja": "はあ、はあ……お待たせしました！\nお疲れさまです、社長、音無さん。", "zh": "呼，呼……让你们久等了！\n辛苦了，社长、音无小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_intro_1014_101kot", "source_sha256": "e3333971feaada50718a78aed8146d3d91683991ccf9c6377736ff0d475007c3", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん。\nずいぶん急いできたんですね、大丈夫ですか？", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生。\n您赶得很急啊，没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_intro_1015_p", "source_sha256": "067e8e436b10721d85449182323208292618552f104b6e7e437074c6cf5091a6", "ja": "ええ、例の企画と聞いて体が\n自然と逸ってしまったもので……！", "zh": "是啊，一听说是那个企划，身体就不由自主地兴奋起来了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "9ae3c4c95674de931b7fe919839ed99eb9dca63e534a9acb66b9d0e8f3e3d547", "ja": "うむ、その気持ちはよくわかるよ！\n私も、君にいち早く知らせたい企画だったからね！", "zh": "嗯，我很理解你的心情！\n因为这也是我想尽早告诉你的企划呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_intro_1017_101kot", "source_sha256": "59364557fb65188f2898471d85549ab6a4464dd7fbd7f4f492d121dc6b10413b", "ja": "あ、『ミリオンシアターシーズン』プロジェクト、\nダイヤモンドに続いてクローバーが始動する件ですね！", "zh": "啊，是指《Million Theater Season》项目继钻石之后，四叶草也要启动这件事吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "8cbc67a6cf8e988688448f75ad7f8c23f4024fd563851c9e997313c53f26df6c", "ja": "ああっ、音無君！\n私が言いたかったのに……！", "zh": "啊，音无君！我本来想说的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_intro_1019_101kot", "source_sha256": "3c2a0d8c36aa70f27b4a6fee7d12a228c4cb6949907c4a56e75abe57c411d349", "ja": "す、すみません社長！　私もやっぱり、\n心のどこかでウキウキしてたみたいで……♪", "zh": "对、对不起，社长！我果然也在心底某个角落里感到雀跃了起来……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_intro_1020_p", "source_sha256": "ebf117e9d6262c3194b935825b913de18d3860512f89af2d036cadafd4bce832", "ja": "なるほど。BRIGHT DIAMONDの次は、\nクローバーの出番というわけですね！", "zh": "原来如此。BRIGHT DIAMOND之后，\n就轮到Clover登场了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_intro_1021_president", "source_sha256": "f513b37157391f8877cad464faefef2b6d0dee291485c9aef9b5810750a67772", "ja": "そのとおり！　次なる13人のアイドルに\n担当してもらうのは……北東エリアだ！", "zh": "没错！接下来由13名偶像负责的区域是……东北地区！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_intro_1022_p", "source_sha256": "6b74853972cdcb42e33bc4b62efa92f1c5b3bff3f8c2433da31798729fd697de", "ja": "なるほど、これからの季節にもぴったりです！\nここに呼んだということは、もしかして……。", "zh": "原来如此，正适合接下来的季节！\n把我叫到这里来，难道说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "53d44173652e6680b422522173502fa90a3b91d19987a3848916058a34d9160b", "ja": "うむ！　その第一弾として、こんな曲を用意してみた。\nまずは君に、聞いてもらおうと思ってね。", "zh": "嗯！作为第一弹，我准备了这样一首歌。\n首先想让你听听。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_intro_1025_p", "source_sha256": "0cfa228744824b29e211a1154b2d7b13c471393f6e552bb7e6f30d1dd9f19860", "ja": "これは……！　儚さも感じさせつつ、不思議と\n迫力もあって……すごい、新鮮な感覚だ……！", "zh": "这首歌……！既让人感受到虚幻无常，又不可思议地充满魄力……好厉害，这种感觉真新鲜……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_intro_1026_president", "source_sha256": "958d493f6cf9cd5e109db141cfd895e6b74bf597b48b38eee86766d418266647", "ja": "気に入ってくれたようだね。これはいわゆる\nコンテンポラリーダンスを想定した楽曲だ！", "zh": "看来你很喜欢呢。这是一首所谓的现代舞曲！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_intro_1027_101kot", "source_sha256": "c3ee917c7561fc23ecc66cabb730577d5abb2558c429f3726c266a9f07b18179", "ja": "コンテンポラリーダンス……舞台やバレエの分野の\nイメージがありますね。先進的、前衛的というか……。", "zh": "现代舞……给人一种舞台和芭蕾领域的印象呢。该说是先进、前卫之类的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_intro_1028_p", "source_sha256": "c6224c7c72a51aaec3d3bb886b3110ffd2da5fe7051b9daf13d1ec7e3a518783", "ja": "ですね。最近でこそTVで見かけたりしますが、\nやはり芸術性が高いイメージがありますね。", "zh": "是啊。虽然最近也会在电视上看到，但果然还是给人一种艺术性很高的印象呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_intro_1029_president", "source_sha256": "b9fba9f0f93edfb3edcf503dbe8cc06ba5740d98867c20e40404b72d37d47389", "ja": "うむ。そしてアイドルの楽曲に用いられた例は、\nまだ数少ない。難易度の高さはあるが……。", "zh": "嗯。而且用于偶像歌曲的先例，\n目前还很少。虽然确实难度很高就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_intro_1030", "source_sha256": "df5ac9b0796ab3aaee5c8febd298db7f4eaf7bee4d0b5d2b89f289908a75c8e9", "ja": "だからこそ！", "zh": "正因如此！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "70085a201559d76a7d08b214d3da75039d88dd00e5e9eb615960050dac45a1e7", "ja": "難易度は高いかもしれません。でも、だからこそ、\nアイドルたちの新境地を切り拓けるはずです！", "zh": "难度或许会很高。但正因为如此，才一定能为偶像们开拓全新的境界！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_intro_2001_president", "source_sha256": "ff11db476197e09141f1252399e51302503ba86f7abbd2f2119614998a64a561", "ja": "うむ！　\n君なら、必ずそう言ってくれると信じていた！", "zh": "嗯！  \n我一直相信你肯定会这么说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_intro_2002_president", "source_sha256": "1ea671c0d6190f5eb227c490a2044af8feafb222532515475b36930598a10afb", "ja": "チーム名は、CLEVER CLOVER。その名の\nとおり、知性のきらめく公演、期待しているよ！", "zh": "队伍名称是CLEVER CLOVER。正如其名，我很期待这场闪耀着智慧光芒的公演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_intro_2003_101kot", "source_sha256": "8f46f1ca8c5aeb5a0b2364d3df21c8ac9f643e89bf4103fe84627ba4f3bf2b1c", "ja": "先進的な表現をアイドルたちの手で……\nどんなものになるか、今から楽しみです♪", "zh": "让偶像们亲手展现前卫的表现形式……\n真期待它最终会呈现出什么样子♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_intro_2004_p", "source_sha256": "f8eaca341f2119aba3c4a43d3edbeadb4cea9385c2f0ee06bb1a565f778ef38a", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　全力で\nプロデュース、やりきってみせます！", "zh": "谢谢！我会竭尽全力，把制作人的工作坚持到底给您看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0210_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0210_story_intro_2005_p", "source_sha256": "67139061504d2542e9eb1702d42496589932f1f7ef3b4fd9b16d240030182405", "ja": "（素晴らしい楽曲だった……まだうまく言語化\nできないけど、ピンときた己の感性を信じよう！）", "zh": "（真是首精彩的歌曲……虽然还没法很好地用语言表达，但还是相信自己那份有所触动的感性吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
